	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100%" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="center" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Nettleshield </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Protects the target group member by doing instant Divine damage to attackers when they successfully attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Chill </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Cold damage to the target opponent. (Does additional instant Divine damage if the target is Elemental) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">11.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Favor of the Phoenix </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Summons a Crystallized Phoenix Egg into the target party member&#39;s inventory. This egg can be used to revive a fallen priest. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Regrowth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Major replenishment of Health over-time to a group member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Bloom </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Instanly heals the target and increases health regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Subterfuge </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Area of effect hate reduction. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid/Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13.4 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Spirit of the Wolf </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases the run speed of the target party member. (Does not stack with Pathfinding abilities) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">14.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Winds of Renewal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Health over-time to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Mossy Balm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cures trauma effects. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Sylvan Touch </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes of Health over-time to a group member. This replenishment does not have a casting time, nor does it cost Power, but it has a significant re-use timer. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Sylvan Wind </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Group heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Vigor </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Increases the Power pool on the target party member. (Compatible with most Power pool augmentation spells) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Effloresce </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instantly heals the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Wild Spirit </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Agility and Arcane mitigations for all party members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Elemental Amending </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cures elemental effects. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Protector of the Forest </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Grants a Wolf form that increases Health and Power pools, increases Armor Class, grants See Hidden vision, and adds a chance for an additional melee special attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Dust cloud </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Covers the target in a dust cloud. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ensnaring Roots </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Snares the target and reduces agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Natures Touch </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ressurects the combat (can be used during combat) and grants regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Blessing of the Grove </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cold Snap </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does Cold damage over-time and decreases Elemental mitigation on the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Barbcoat </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Protects the target group member by doing instant Divine damage to attackers when they successfully attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Primeval Instinct </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the targets offensive skills. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Nereids Boon </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grants enduring breath and increased arcane resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Wisp </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Reduces hate, snares the target and teleports the caster a short distance away. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Healing Breeze </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Instant group heal </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Blessing of Earth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Group regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Natures Caress </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instantly heals the target and grants heals over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Favor of the Untamed </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Power and Elemental mitigation for the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Perennial Essence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the groups hit points, wards against elemental damage, and grants health over time out of combat. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Oakskin </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the targets power, cold and heat resistances. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Rowyls Form of the Vale </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Changes the casters form </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Natures Flame </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals heat damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Blessing of the Wild </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups strength, agility, and arcane resistance. Also has a chance to heal the party when attacking. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Natures Embrace </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Instantly heals the target and heals damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Winds of Frost </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Cold damage to the target and surrounding encounter members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Protection of the Seasons </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups agility, wisdom, ac, and elemental resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Warden of the Forest </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Grants a Wolf form that increases Health and Power pools, increases Armor Class, grants See Hidden vision, and adds a chance for an additional melee special attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Numbing Spores </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that has the chance to replenish Health over-time whenever successfully attacked, also slows the attacker if triggered. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Frost </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals cold damage and reduces elemental resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grasping Roots </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Snares the target and reduces agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Call of the Fae </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Changes the casters form. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">37 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Nereids Kiss </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants enduring breath and increased arcane resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Bramblecoat </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants the target a damage shield. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bitter Frost </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals cold damage and can deal extra damage against elementals. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Verdurous Journey </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Transports the party members within range to the nearest designated safe spot for the current adventuring area. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Curse of the Un-Natural </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Changes the target into a hideous creature. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Form of the Strange Bear </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Transforms the caster into a bear. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">40.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Primal Instinct </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases all Offensive skills on the target party member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Seizing Brambles </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect hate reduction, also snares the targets. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Essence of the Kodiak </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the targets hit points. Out of combat it increases power regen and wards against elemental damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Natures Reprieve </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Prevents death by healing the target at death, also increases health regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Chloroplast </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups healing regeneration and elemental resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Verdant Sigh </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Health over-time and reduces Hate towards the caster on successful attacks. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Chlorostorm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Group regen and wards against elemental damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Gale of Healing </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Group heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">43 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Sylvan Waters </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instantly heals the target and grants regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">43.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Praise of the Untamed </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Power and Elemental mitigation for the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Sylph </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect hate reducer. Also snares the targets and teleports the caster a short distance away. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Aspect of the Owl </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the targets power pool, heat and cold resistances. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Fury of the Storm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Every now and then, a warden may wish to remind someone of inappropriate disposition towards the forests. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Duststorm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Grants increased avoidance to all party members but forces the caster to remain stationary for the duration of the spell. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Winters Bite </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals cold damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Winds of Winter </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Area of effect cold damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Verdant Rapture </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Instantly heals the target and grants regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Benison of the Wild </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the groups strength, agility, and arcane resistance. It also has a chance to heal the group when they attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Undergrowth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Area of effect agility debuff and snare. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Spirit of the Oak </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups agility, wisdom, ac, and elemental resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">48 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Steward of the Forest </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grants wolf form. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Tranquilizing Spores </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants a chance of regen and slow on attacker, when the target is hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Seizing Vines </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Decreases the tagets agility and snares. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Rowyls Furious Barrier </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Surrounds the caster with gentle runes. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Warden </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Hierophantic Genesis </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Regen that immobilizes the caster. </td></tr></tbody></table>
	
